{"id":15693175652726,"title":"Reachy Mini Lite","handle":"reachy-mini-lite-version","description":"\u003ch2\u003eExpressive Robotics Powered by Your Computer \u003cstrong\u003e(Suggested for developers only)\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReachy Mini Lite delivers rich robotic expressiveness and a full sensor suite, all driven by your own computer over USB-C. It's the ideal entry point for developers, researchers, and makers who want to build, learn, and experiment with robotics and AI without the added cost of on-board compute.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eKey Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e9 servo motors for expressive, fluid movements\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e6-DOF head motion (roll, pitch, yaw, x, y, z)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e±160° body rotation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 animated antennas\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWide-angle camera\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e4-microphone array\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e5W speaker\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSB-C connectivity\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePower supply included\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eShips as a DIY Kit\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEverything you need to build your Reachy Mini is included across 3 boxes: structure, motors, electronics, camera, microphones, speaker, screws, and accessories. No 3D printer or soldering required. Tools and a detailed assembly guide are included.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eShipping \u0026amp; Import Duties\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLead time: up to 90 days after purchase (many orders ship sooner). Import duties are calculated and added at checkout based on your destination country.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCountry of origin: China. Designed in Bordeaux, France by Pollen Robotics.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-04-20T12:34:54+02:00","created_at":"2026-04-08T18:10:37+02:00","vendor":"Reachy Mini by Pollen